SUMMARY:GTApreneurs January 26\, 2027 Vaughan Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, please go here to COMPLETE YOUR REGISTRATION: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/networking-events-vaughan\n\nJoin us at an exciting Business Networking
  Event in Vaughan (1 block north of Toronto) on Tuesday January 26 where y
 ou can meet potential clients and referral partners\, learn something new\
 , enjoy a meal and promote your business!\n\n* **EVENT TIME:** 5:00-8:00pm
 \n* **VENUE:** Improve Canada\, 2nd floor auditorium\n* **ADDRESS:** 7250 
 Keele St\, Vaughan\, ON (Between Steeles Ave W. and 407)\n* **PARKING:** F
 ree\, onsite. Park on the NORTH SIDE of the building off of Snidercroft Rd
 \n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-6:00pm:** Open networking\, food buff
 et\, visit exhibitor booths\n* **6:00-6:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming pres
 entation\n* **6:10-6:30pm:** Guest Speaker Presentation: Brad Aylward\, **
 *"Beyond the Banks – Mortgages for the Self-Employed"***\n* **6:30-7:00p
 m:** Exhibitor Introductions + member Elevator Pitches\n* **7:00-8:00pm:**
  Open networking\, visit exhibitors\n\n**TICKETS:** $25 in advance or $27 
 on event day\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view our memberships 
 and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships\n\n*
 *QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text **Tammy** at (416) 522-7770 or
  info@gtapreneurs.com\n\nThis event will feature Guest Speaker **Brad Aylw
 ard**\, Mortgage Agent\, Level 2\, Mortgage Architects\, Lic # 12728. With
  over 18 years of banking experience\, Brad brings insider knowledge and e
 xpertise to his role as a Level 2 Mortgage Agent with Mortgage Architects 
 in Aurora\, Ontario. With access to banks\, credit unions\, and alternativ
 e lenders\, Brad helps clients find mortgage solutions beyond the limitati
 ons of traditional banking.\n\nContact **Brad** at (647) 888-6383 or brad@
 easyasnow.com and visit [www.bhamortgagecorp.com](www.bhamortgagecorp.com)
  to learn more about his services.\n\n**EXHIBITORS:**\n\n* **Abhishek Basa
 k**\, Clerk Tech\, www.clerk-tech.com\n* **Balbir Pabila**\, PPLSI\\~Legal
 Shield\, https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com\n* **Moiz Ur Rehman**\,
  Allstate\, www.agents.allstate.ca/on/newmarket/17725-yonge-st-n/moiz-ur-r
 ehman\n* **Robert Kennedy**\, Kennedy-Marques Real Estate Group\, [www.rjk
 ennedyrealestate.com](www.rjkennedyrealestate.com)\n* **Sonia Kurmey**\, A
 rbonne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com\n\n**\\*Want to stand out?** Visit ww
 w.gtapreneurs.com/exhibitor to book your exhibitor table\n\n\\*We will EMA
 IL you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET the day after the event by 5pm. If you don
 ’t receive it in your inbox\, please check your SPAM/JUNK folder. Note: 
 You must attend the event to receive the guest contact sheet.\n\n**Want 1-
 1 help with your business?** Learn about Tammy Defoe's business coaching s
 ervices here: https://gtapreneurs.com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/bu
 siness-coaching-toronto
